    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calling all Dungeon Masters! Have you ever wanted a tool that allows you to easily keep track of combat, all in one simple, easy-to-use page? Look no further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tracker is your one-stop-shop for any battle that your PCs may encounter, whether you are running a virtual or in-person campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC and PC Generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initiative Calculation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple HP Calculator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaction Tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Tracking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC selection for easy search</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC Death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End Round Button (reactivates all reactions and ticks down all statuses)</p></li></ul>",
